  "compare_url": "https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/compare/main...CubeJerry:research/global-bilateral-half-gaussian-20261113?expand=1&title=Construct+a+global+integer+bijection+for+the+Hadamard%2FGaussian+pair+with+optimal+bidirectional+norm+slack+1%2F2&body=%23%23+Result+and+why+it+matters%0A%0AThis+establishes+an+explicit+%2A%2Aglobal%2A%2A+integer+bijection+for+%60H4%2F2%60%2C+and+by+signed+permutations+for+the+ideal+Gaussian+pair+%60C%2B%60%2C+with+error+at+most+one+and+optimal+%2A%2Abilateral%2A%2A+radial+slack+%601%2F2%60.+Every+input+has+strict+radial+change+below+%601%2F2%60%2C+while+explicit+forward+and+inverse+sequences+approach+that+value.+The+all-input+lower+bound+applies+to+every+total+error-one+integer+map%2C+without+injectivity+or+a+periodicity+premise.%0A%0AThis+is+progress+on+the+norm-rounding+obligation+behind+an+alternative+precision%2Fnative+interface.+It+is+not+a+finite-search+extrapolation%2C+a+completed+selected+supplier%2C+or+an+unconditional+multiplication+theorem.%0A%0A%23%23+What+changed%0A%0A-+An+explicit+staggered+matching+of+the+half-integer+grid%2C+complete+coset+bijections%2C+exact+inverse+and+universal+norm+proof.%0A-+A+16-corner+unrestricted+lower-bound+sequence+establishing+optimal+bilateral+slack.%0A-+A+reusable+exact+integer+kernel+for+the+Hadamard+and+Gaussian+forward%2Finverse+maps.%0A-+Separately+written+proof+and+implementation+checks%2C+a+root+implementation+comparison%2C+exact+negative+controls+and+a+registered+bounded+replay+manifest.%0A-+Explicit+counterexamples+showing+that+this+construction+does+not+inherit+conserved+complex+sum%2C+global+%60i%60+covariance%2C+inverse-by-conjugation+or+fourth-power+identity.%0A%0AThe+actual+Gaussian+inverse+is+%60S+F_H%5E-1+L%60.+It+must+not+be+replaced+by+conjugating+the+positive+rounded+operation.%0A%0A%23%23+Novelty+relative+to+prior+work%0A%0AAli+Romman%27s+%236509+provides+the+earlier+reversible+conservative+Gaussian+rounding+and+stronger-invariant+contract.+Nick+Pet