e+tariff%2C+recursive+precision+budget+or+all-size+compiler+transfer+is+admitted.+The+arithmetic+kernel+has+unbounded+integer+inputs%3B+a+machine-model+implementation+must+pay+its+complete+costs.+The+stronger+native+identities+fail+for+this+construction+and+require+separate+work.%0A%0A%23%23+Kappa+status%0A%0A%2A%2ANo+new+kappa.%2A%2A+The+pinned+selected+%60kappa+%3D+363005817%2F100000000000%60+and+all+five+framework+assumptions+remain+unchanged.+The+full+multiplication+bound+remains+conditional.%0A%0A%23%23+Credit+and+assistance%0A%0APrepared+for+%2A%2A%40CubeJerry%2A%2A+with+substantial+OpenAI+ChatGPT%2FCodex+assistance.+The+root+supplied+the+construction%2C+a+separate+proof+role+developed+and+challenged+the+all-input+proof%2C+a+separate+implementation+role+tested+the+mechanism%2C+and+the+root+checked+an+independently+written+implementation+and+the+actual+Gaussian+interfaces.+Shared+proposed+formulas+are+disclosed%3B+no+blind%2C+human+or+formal-kernel+review+is+claimed.%0A%0ACredit+Ali+Romman+%28%236509%29%2C+Nick+Petalas+%28%236619%29%2C+ywz65+%28%232589%29%2C+and+the+earlier+finite+Hall+and+affine-period+packages.+The+preserved+notices+and+exact+source+pins+identify+predecessor+contributions.+Apache-2.0.%0A",
